WEBVTT

00:05.670 --> 00:08.360
A... ki... ra...

00:14.540 --> 00:18.010
That was nasty, Aki-lovely.

00:18.010 --> 00:20.720
Milulun's so scared.

00:20.720 --> 00:23.750
I have to... continue battling...

00:23.750 --> 00:24.750
Huh?

00:24.750 --> 00:26.690
Selector battle...

00:26.690 --> 00:27.960
Oh...?

00:27.960 --> 00:30.560
What's your wish?

00:30.560 --> 00:34.060
For Urith's... scar...

00:34.060 --> 00:36.620
...to heal quickly...

00:38.530 --> 00:40.760
No problem-lun!

00:42.070 --> 00:44.300
Aki-lucky...

01:02.620 --> 01:04.130
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

01:04.130 --> 01:08.130
<i>ideals are repetitious games that slip through</i>

01:08.130 --> 01:10.830
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

01:10.830 --> 01:13.740
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

01:13.740 --> 01:15.000
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

01:15.000 --> 01:19.240
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

01:19.240 --> 01:24.280
<i>The final bell holding together</i> <i>the crumbling day rings</i>

01:24.280 --> 01:28.680
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

01:28.680 --> 01:31.320
<i>you're there</i>

01:31.320 --> 01:34.120
<i>with a smile</i>

01:34.120 --> 01:39.630
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

01:39.630 --> 01:43.090
<i>And still</i>

01:44.770 --> 01:47.940
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

01:47.940 --> 01:52.210
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

01:52.210 --> 01:54.640
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

01:54.640 --> 01:56.310
<i>Now cross</i>

01:56.310 --> 01:58.980
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

01:58.980 --> 02:06.050
<i>The future of light and dark,</i> <i>let's believe in the "future"</i>

02:06.050 --> 02:12.550
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

02:14.900 --> 02:16.800
Hitoe, are you all right?

02:16.460 --> 02:18.130
"From: Mom"

02:16.460 --> 02:18.130
"Re: Sorry for making you worried"

02:16.800 --> 02:18.330
Does it hurt anywhere?

02:18.330 --> 02:22.400
No, I'm fine. I was just surprised back there.

02:22.400 --> 02:24.810
I'm sorry. It's my fault...

02:24.810 --> 02:27.740
No, I'm sorry, too.

02:27.740 --> 02:30.810
--Ruko, I made you go through all that pain.
--But...!

02:30.810 --> 02:34.250
I brought back Iona-<i>san</i>'s bitter memories, too...

02:35.920 --> 02:37.890
How softhearted can you get?

02:37.890 --> 02:39.190
Huh?

02:39.190 --> 02:42.190
We were originally made by Mayu.

02:42.190 --> 02:46.190
So you can say that we created Selector battles.

02:46.190 --> 02:47.860
But in the first place, Mayu--

02:47.860 --> 02:51.100
You girls have every right to hate me!

02:51.100 --> 02:54.740
And yet, the words you say are...

02:54.740 --> 02:57.710
This Mayu person shouldn't be forgiven...

02:57.710 --> 02:59.910
...I think, but...

02:59.910 --> 03:06.510
Before becoming friends with Ruko and Yuzuki, the days I spent were excruciating.

03:09.580 --> 03:15.390
When I took a stroll, everyone around me seemed happy...

03:15.390 --> 03:19.690
...and it felt like I was the only lonely one in the world.

03:19.690 --> 03:23.230
But, after hearing what Iona-<i>san</i> said...

03:23.230 --> 03:29.640
...I understand now, how Mayu couldn't even feel what loneliness is.

03:32.270 --> 03:33.910
That's it...

03:33.910 --> 03:35.910
Maybe that's it...

03:35.910 --> 03:37.310
About what?

03:37.310 --> 03:41.150
Mayu's... real wish.

03:41.150 --> 03:44.220
Real wish...?

03:44.220 --> 03:47.590
It... felt weird to me...

03:47.590 --> 03:51.330
...as to why Mayu made the rules to the Selector battles like how it is now.

03:51.330 --> 03:55.060
The girl who wins has their wish taken away, and is sealed into a card.

03:55.060 --> 04:00.000
That's horrible, but it felt a bit different from revenge...

04:02.070 --> 04:07.440
Well... things are fine when we're talking like this, but...

04:07.440 --> 04:12.580
...being in the card is... pretty lonely.

04:12.580 --> 04:14.420
Really...

04:14.420 --> 04:16.180
...lonely.

04:17.920 --> 04:26.430
Maybe Mayu wants to have everyone know how it really feels to be lonely...

04:26.430 --> 04:28.430
Yuzuki...

04:28.430 --> 04:32.270
I'm sorry I made you feel like that!

04:32.270 --> 04:35.870
Yuzuki, from now on I'll hold you close to me, even when I go to sleep!

04:35.870 --> 04:37.810
Aah! I'm okay!

04:37.810 --> 04:41.170
C'mon, stop holding me!

04:43.480 --> 04:45.110
Iona...

04:51.050 --> 04:52.490
Unbelievable...

04:52.490 --> 04:53.520
Huh?

04:53.520 --> 04:55.960
With all that everyone went through...

04:55.960 --> 05:01.130
...no one is thinking badly about Mayu.

05:01.130 --> 05:04.230
Well, that's not entirely true...

05:04.230 --> 05:08.370
I think we feel like how we feel now...

05:08.370 --> 05:11.840
...because of Tama and you, Iona.

05:11.840 --> 05:17.250
I mean, if Tama and Iona together is like Mayu...

05:17.250 --> 05:21.220
...it's hard to imagine
Mayu is really a bad person.

05:21.220 --> 05:23.750
Tama... and me?

05:23.750 --> 05:27.420
Tama and Iona are our friends, right?

05:27.420 --> 05:34.160
Then I believe that Mayu would understand if we spoke from our hearts.

05:35.400 --> 05:38.830
My heart... aches...

05:38.830 --> 05:44.740
It must be from this feeling I hold, despite being the LRIG of dark.

05:44.740 --> 05:48.580
But, even if it aches, this feeling...

05:48.580 --> 05:50.910
...is so warm.

05:50.910 --> 05:53.400
I want to embrace this feeling...

05:57.220 --> 06:00.380
Weird... Weird...

06:04.430 --> 06:06.390
This is so weird!

06:08.900 --> 06:11.430
Kuro's not the same anymore.

06:11.430 --> 06:13.740
Selector battles...

06:13.740 --> 06:18.110
...need intense light and deep darkness.

06:18.110 --> 06:24.710
Let's burn the useless LRIG card of dark.

06:24.710 --> 06:27.240
Okay, Shiro?

06:28.750 --> 06:31.790
I can't believe the pampering...

06:31.790 --> 06:34.660
A private hospital room for this measly wound?

06:34.660 --> 06:36.720
As expected from the Urazoe Family...

06:36.720 --> 06:39.130
Are you okay, Urith?

06:39.130 --> 06:41.890
It's just a small wound.

06:43.930 --> 06:46.300
Say, mind if I ask you something?

06:46.300 --> 06:47.170
Huh?

06:47.170 --> 06:52.670
Iona passed through many
Selectors' hands as an LRIG of dark.

06:52.670 --> 06:56.740
Where were you until you ended up as Ru's card?

06:56.740 --> 06:59.910
Well, Tama was...

06:59.910 --> 07:02.950
...with Ru before I knew it.

07:02.950 --> 07:07.760
I forgot about Mayu and everything that happened...

07:07.760 --> 07:11.260
...but after meeting Ru...

07:11.260 --> 07:17.770
...I felt that Tama was born because I wanted to meet Ru.

07:17.770 --> 07:19.600
I see...

07:19.600 --> 07:21.940
I know just how Mayu feels.

07:21.940 --> 07:22.940
Huh?

07:22.940 --> 07:27.840
You're like vomit, so Mayu wanted to get rid of you.

07:27.840 --> 07:36.020
She was disgusted by the hypocritical desire for light that clung like scum to her heart...

07:36.020 --> 07:40.290
That's why she put you into Ruko's hands first.

07:40.290 --> 07:42.860
After all, she is a terrifying girl.

07:42.860 --> 07:46.320
A girl who can destroy everything...

07:53.330 --> 07:56.070
Chiyori? What next?

07:56.070 --> 07:57.140
What do you mean?

07:57.140 --> 08:00.580
Even if I know the truth behind the battles, I'm not giving up-y!

08:00.580 --> 08:03.910
I'm gonna go to the next battle-y!

08:03.910 --> 08:06.380
Aren't you going to do your usual stuff?

08:06.380 --> 08:08.020
Such evil...

08:08.020 --> 08:09.050
Huh?

08:09.050 --> 08:13.350
Chiyori pretty much knows how these Selector battles work now!

08:13.350 --> 08:16.220
Win or lose, only hell waits...

08:16.220 --> 08:18.730
You're the type who can calmly toss someone into

08:18.730 --> 08:22.330
that kind of inescapable, incessant hell, Eldora!

08:22.330 --> 08:26.170
Heheh... Well, you've got to protect yourself.

08:27.440 --> 08:29.570
But, come on, remember what you said?

08:29.570 --> 08:34.110
Chiyori, your wish is to enter the world of WIXOSS, right?

08:34.110 --> 08:35.680
Works out perfect, you know?

08:35.680 --> 08:37.540
You're right...

08:39.350 --> 08:43.780
But if Chiyori loses again,
I won't be able to battle anymore...

08:43.780 --> 08:46.220
Well, no use dwelling on it.

08:46.220 --> 08:48.720
We'll cross that bridge when we get to it.

08:48.720 --> 08:50.950
I guess...

08:53.930 --> 08:57.900
Speaking of, you were once a human, right Eldora?

08:57.900 --> 08:59.730
What was your wish then?

08:59.730 --> 09:00.800
Huh?

09:00.800 --> 09:02.300
Aah...

09:02.300 --> 09:03.070
...I forgot.

09:03.070 --> 09:04.140
Liar!

09:04.140 --> 09:06.710
Yeah, I'm lying.

09:06.710 --> 09:08.910
Like, I don't want to tell you, Chiyori.

09:08.910 --> 09:10.080
Why you...!

09:10.080 --> 09:12.650
Yup, nothing special at all.

09:12.650 --> 09:16.450
Now that I think about it, the wish was really nothing.

09:16.450 --> 09:20.150
But, I guess I was serious about it back then.

09:24.730 --> 09:29.100
In any case, we need to speak with Tama-<i>chan</i>, right?

09:29.100 --> 09:30.730
But, Hitoe...

09:30.730 --> 09:33.470
...are you okay meeting Urith?

09:33.470 --> 09:34.570
That's right.

09:34.570 --> 09:36.340
Ruko and I can go without you.

09:36.340 --> 09:37.570
No...

09:37.570 --> 09:40.010
After all, this is to meet Tama-<i>chan.</i>

09:40.010 --> 09:41.410
That's--

09:42.140 --> 09:43.340
"New Mail"

09:42.140 --> 09:43.340
"1"

09:45.180 --> 09:47.110
Maybe it's Urith!

09:50.620 --> 09:53.020
Please battle me!

09:53.020 --> 09:54.090
Huh?

09:54.090 --> 09:58.760
It doesn't matter which of you two I face, so please!

09:58.760 --> 10:03.430
W-Wait! Chiyori-<i>san,</i> if you lose once more, then...

10:03.430 --> 10:05.130
Justice will prevail!

10:05.130 --> 10:08.370
So... that means, I'm evil?

10:08.370 --> 10:12.810
You still don't understand after seeing Fumio?

10:12.810 --> 10:14.830
Well then...

10:16.780 --> 10:19.380
...how about doing it with me?

10:19.380 --> 10:20.950
Come on...

10:20.950 --> 10:23.540
...battle me...

10:24.890 --> 10:26.950
I sense an unusual, evildoer aura...

10:26.950 --> 10:28.390
A-Akira-<i>san</i>!

10:28.390 --> 10:29.890
Oh, okay.

10:29.890 --> 10:31.330
Huh?!

10:31.330 --> 10:32.790
C'mon, let's do this.

10:32.790 --> 10:38.170
Hey, Eldora! What are you doing, making a call without the Selector!

10:38.170 --> 10:42.500
Oh? Are you scared of losing?

10:42.500 --> 10:44.540
Heck no!

10:44.540 --> 10:47.070
All right-y then! Let's battle!

10:47.070 --> 10:50.310
Chiyori's gonna win this easy!

10:52.380 --> 10:53.380
No...!

10:53.380 --> 10:55.220
No way!

10:55.220 --> 10:56.380
No!

10:58.320 --> 11:00.890
Wait... Wa...

11:00.890 --> 11:03.520
Wait the hell up!

11:03.520 --> 11:05.650
Bastards...!

11:08.900 --> 11:10.230
What?

11:22.010 --> 11:26.180
Akira-<i>san</i> isn't going to... chase us, right?

11:26.180 --> 11:27.580
Hey!

11:27.580 --> 11:28.750
What gives?!

11:28.750 --> 11:30.690
Why'd you get in my way?!

11:30.690 --> 11:31.690
But...!

11:31.690 --> 11:35.120
If you really want to battle, then we won't stop you...

11:35.120 --> 11:36.960
...but at least be a bit more selective of who you--

11:36.960 --> 11:39.430
It doesn't matter who we face.

11:39.430 --> 11:40.430
What?

11:40.430 --> 11:44.600
Yup! No matter who I face,
Chiyori's gonna win, y'know?

11:44.600 --> 11:48.700
Oh? Pretty bold, coming from someone who lost twice already.

11:48.700 --> 11:53.270
Hmph! Once Chiyori wins, it's gonna be bye-bye to Eldora!

11:53.270 --> 11:56.410
Oh yes, that's good news indeed!

11:56.410 --> 11:58.910
Wha...?! Why you...!

11:58.910 --> 12:01.780
I'll... battle Chiyori-<i>san.</i>

12:01.780 --> 12:03.450
--Wha...?!
--Huh?!

12:03.450 --> 12:07.720
Chiyori lost twice already! Anymore and...

12:07.720 --> 12:10.660
...you know what's going to happen, right?

12:10.660 --> 12:12.260
A reversal of her wish.

12:12.260 --> 12:13.560
Hitoe...

12:13.560 --> 12:15.130
I understand.

12:15.130 --> 12:19.130
I'm going to do this, because
Chiyori-<i>san</i> is only one loss away.

12:19.130 --> 12:19.900
What?

12:19.900 --> 12:22.770
Don't tell me you're planning to give her a win.

12:22.770 --> 12:24.410
No.

12:24.410 --> 12:30.610
Before my wish got reversed with my third loss, Midoriko said to me...

12:30.610 --> 12:31.610
Hitoe!

12:31.610 --> 12:33.480
Please! Get rid of me!

12:33.480 --> 12:38.520
Midoriko... wished for me to be with friends forever...

12:38.520 --> 12:42.960
...at the cost of having a chance to be human again.

12:42.960 --> 12:44.660
My wish...

12:44.660 --> 12:48.330
...is a wish that I thought would make me happy when fulfilled.

12:48.330 --> 12:50.800
But, Chiyori-<i>san</i>'s wish is...

12:50.800 --> 12:52.970
Aah! Just shut it!

12:52.970 --> 12:55.470
"Shut it" is my line!

12:55.470 --> 12:59.310
Once Chiyori becomes heroine of the WIXOSS world, your time of punishment will come!

12:59.310 --> 13:02.110
Oh, yeah? Bring it!

13:02.110 --> 13:07.480
I see. If seeing Fumio didn't get through to her, then we may as well...

13:07.480 --> 13:10.620
If Chiyori-<i>san</i> wins, then it's another story, but...

13:10.620 --> 13:13.820
...if I win, I can prevent her wish.

13:13.820 --> 13:18.790
Well, it does bother me what would happen if her wish got reversed...

13:18.790 --> 13:23.030
Chiyori-<i>san</i>'s wish is based on her attachment to WIXOSS...

13:23.030 --> 13:26.070
...so if it's just a matter of her forgetting about WIXOSS...

13:26.070 --> 13:29.830
...then it shouldn't make her situation any worse.

13:31.910 --> 13:34.310
Augh! Now Chiyori's mad!

13:34.310 --> 13:38.250
I'm gonna win for real! This'll really be the last time I'll be with you, Eldora!

13:38.250 --> 13:39.350
Whatever.

13:39.350 --> 13:41.350
--Um...
--Huh?

13:41.350 --> 13:44.720
I can battle you, Chiyori-<i>san.</i>

13:44.720 --> 13:45.740
Huh?

13:50.320 --> 13:52.990
Yay! Battle-y!

13:52.990 --> 13:54.160
Finally, finally!

13:54.160 --> 13:58.000
The historic moment to be inscribed, the first step to the birth of a heroine

13:58.000 --> 13:59.870
of the WIXOSS world!

13:59.530 --> 14:01.730
"Authorized construction workers only"

14:02.240 --> 14:03.100
Let's begin.

14:03.100 --> 14:05.240
I can't wait!

14:05.240 --> 14:06.610
Open!

14:08.010 --> 14:11.680
A battlefield opened...

14:11.680 --> 14:17.050
Looks like there are others who, at this very moment, are seeking battles.

14:17.050 --> 14:19.190
Are you... going to battle?

14:19.190 --> 14:20.720
Doesn't it hurt?

14:20.720 --> 14:24.460
Well, of course it hurts. Just a little.

14:24.460 --> 14:26.630
But soon the pain will go away.

14:26.630 --> 14:29.360
I'm... going to win the battle.

14:29.360 --> 14:33.370
I've stacked sufficient wins, so just one more will make my wish come true.

14:33.370 --> 14:35.540
I'll become an LRIG again.

14:35.540 --> 14:37.040
And you...

14:37.040 --> 14:40.700
...will gain Urazoe Iona's body and come outside.

14:41.710 --> 14:44.110
Tama... into Iona...?

14:44.110 --> 14:47.720
You want to be on equal terms as friends with Ruko, right?

14:47.720 --> 14:50.750
Isn't that your wish?

14:50.750 --> 14:54.820
If so, our interests are mutual.

14:54.820 --> 14:58.090
If we win the battle, this body will be yours.

14:58.090 --> 15:03.090
You can be friends with Ru, not as an LRIG, but as a fellow human being.

15:04.800 --> 15:06.470
Here we go!

15:06.470 --> 15:08.800
Chiyori Moonlight Chorizo!

15:08.800 --> 15:10.960
Say the correct name of the move!

15:14.980 --> 15:16.840
Not bad, Chorizo!

15:16.840 --> 15:18.250
Are you okay, Yuzuki?

15:18.250 --> 15:19.850
No problem!

15:19.850 --> 15:23.180
We can't lose this battle after all.

15:23.180 --> 15:24.180
Yup.

15:24.180 --> 15:26.120
Yuzuki! Grow!

15:26.990 --> 15:29.460
Both Eldora and Yuzuki are strong.

15:29.460 --> 15:32.330
But the match is pretty much decided...

15:32.330 --> 15:33.330
Yup...

15:33.330 --> 15:38.030
Yuzuki's deck is red-themed, and contains cards with the ability to shave Ener.

15:38.030 --> 15:42.200
The odds are really against
Chiyori-<i>san</i> winning, right?

15:42.200 --> 15:44.970
Chiyori probably doesn't know that.

15:44.970 --> 15:50.170
But... there's no way Eldora, as an LRIG, doesn't know that.

15:51.310 --> 15:52.510
Wait...

15:57.320 --> 16:01.390
No... I'm going to lose...
If this keeps up, I'm going to lose...!

16:01.390 --> 16:02.990
Chiyori! Your command!

16:02.990 --> 16:04.530
B-But, but...

16:04.530 --> 16:06.560
It's okay even if you lose, y'know?

16:06.560 --> 16:07.900
Huh?

16:07.900 --> 16:10.160
You're going to retire from Selector battles...

16:10.160 --> 16:13.400
...and go back to being a normal girl.

16:13.400 --> 16:14.870
Eldora-<i>san...</i>

16:14.870 --> 16:19.070
I knew it... Eldora was thinking of the same thing as Hitoe!

16:19.070 --> 16:23.510
To save Chiyori-<i>san</i> from the painful battles...

16:23.510 --> 16:25.980
Wh-What are you saying, Eldora?!

16:25.980 --> 16:27.550
Excuse me!

16:27.550 --> 16:31.150
Um, I know it's out of place to ask this during battle, but...

16:31.150 --> 16:35.220
...even if I lose, can you be friends with her?

16:35.220 --> 16:36.390
Wha...?!

16:36.390 --> 16:42.660
She's dressed loony now, but back when
I first met her, she was, like, super modest.

16:42.660 --> 16:45.100
H-Hey! Eldora!

16:50.000 --> 16:52.870
Th-The card spoke...?

16:52.870 --> 16:55.080
My name is Eldora.

16:55.080 --> 16:57.680
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

16:57.680 --> 16:59.180
Hm?

16:59.180 --> 17:00.850
So cute...!

17:00.850 --> 17:02.580
Super cute!

17:02.580 --> 17:04.950
Shh...!

17:04.950 --> 17:08.360
Say, look at this! It's so Eldora!

17:08.360 --> 17:10.090
Trying to mimic me?

17:10.090 --> 17:13.430
That, "I gotta be like the other girls" mentality is kinda creepy.

17:13.430 --> 17:17.300
Aww, come on. If you don't like that, then wear something else, Eldora!

17:17.300 --> 17:19.200
I'm just paper, so... nope!

17:19.200 --> 17:22.600
Okay! Then Chiyori's gonna use a marker to draw... your clothes!

17:22.600 --> 17:23.470
Haah?!

17:23.470 --> 17:24.570
Time to draw!

17:24.570 --> 17:25.910
Stop it!

17:25.910 --> 17:27.470
She can be a handful,

17:27.470 --> 17:31.910
but I was glad she was my Selector.

17:33.310 --> 17:38.290
She's a bit soft on the top, but she really isn't bad or anything.

17:38.290 --> 17:39.550
Eldora...

17:39.550 --> 17:43.890
From the very beginning... you were planning to lose, weren't you?

17:43.890 --> 17:45.330
E-Eldora?!

17:45.330 --> 17:48.460
I thought we couldn't win, that's all.

17:48.460 --> 17:51.300
Not like LRIGs can sway the end results or anything.

17:51.300 --> 17:54.100
That's mean! You didn't tell Chiyori that!

17:54.100 --> 17:57.970
Here comes the evil you again, Eldora!

17:57.970 --> 18:01.140
--Sure, evil. Like you said, I'm evil.

17:57.970 --> 17:59.470
--Why you...!

17:59.470 --> 18:01.140
--Take this!

18:01.140 --> 18:02.410
That's why...

18:02.410 --> 18:03.810
...we shouldn't be together.

18:03.810 --> 18:04.810
Huh?!

18:04.810 --> 18:08.350
I was glad I became your LRIG, but only once.

18:08.350 --> 18:12.250
You're so optimistic, stupid, dim-witted...

18:12.250 --> 18:14.250
...and really carefree.

18:14.250 --> 18:15.960
Eldora...?

18:15.960 --> 18:17.960
I●●●

18:17.960 --> 18:21.690
...just want you to stay like that, y'know?

18:23.100 --> 18:24.500
Eldora...

18:24.500 --> 18:28.040
Now then, Yuzuki-<i>san.</i>
Let's get this over with!

18:28.040 --> 18:30.170
What's next? Orochi?

18:30.170 --> 18:34.940
You've got enough of them Eners, so how about going all out with Arts?

18:34.940 --> 18:37.210
Hold it!

18:39.050 --> 18:39.950
Chiyori...?

18:39.950 --> 18:41.880
It's... It's not over yet!

18:41.880 --> 18:44.450
Chiyori's brain, get working!

18:44.450 --> 18:46.820
Think of a way to turn the tables!

18:46.820 --> 18:49.990
If I don't, then...

18:49.990 --> 18:53.150
...I'm gonna get separated from Eldora!

18:57.500 --> 18:59.800
Ah...! I got it!

18:59.800 --> 19:00.500
Huh?

19:00.500 --> 19:04.340
Check their Life Cloth with Spell: PLUS RUSH!

19:05.810 --> 19:09.640
Direct damage using Arts: Cloth Crash Flash!

19:09.640 --> 19:11.580
Chiyori... that attack...

19:11.580 --> 19:14.510
Go...!

19:21.760 --> 19:23.360
...is meaningless.

19:23.360 --> 19:24.590
Huh...?

19:24.590 --> 19:27.930
Our attacks aren't going to get through to Hitoe-<i>san</i> now.

19:27.930 --> 19:33.400
If Chiyori doesn't pull a Shiira within 3 turns, Hitoe-<i>san</i> will win.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.540
Eldora-<i>san...</i>

19:34.540 --> 19:39.040
Now hold on! Don't you try to make yourself lose here.

19:39.040 --> 19:42.040
I want to return back into a human, y'know?

19:42.040 --> 19:46.510
But, if I'm stuck with an unskilled person like Chiyori...

19:46.510 --> 19:48.350
...that'll never come true.

19:48.350 --> 19:49.950
Eldora...

19:49.950 --> 19:52.620
Now, let's keep going, Chiyori.

19:51.750 --> 19:53.950
"Mystic Water"

19:51.750 --> 19:53.950
"Jellyfish"

19:52.620 --> 19:56.420
If you can put a Burst into play, there's a chance of winning.

20:00.960 --> 20:02.430
Turn end.

20:04.800 --> 20:06.630
Orochi! Echidna!

20:06.630 --> 20:07.970
Attack!

20:11.640 --> 20:13.310
Eldora!

20:13.310 --> 20:14.980
It's your turn, Chiyori...

20:14.980 --> 20:17.810
No... No! Eldora!

20:17.810 --> 20:20.300
Chiyori's not going to forget...!

20:21.480 --> 20:22.820
Turn end.

20:22.820 --> 20:25.490
I'm never, ever going to forget!

20:25.490 --> 20:28.420
Because, Eldora...!

20:28.420 --> 20:34.800
When Chiyori gets inside WIXOSS,
I'm making you Chiyori's subordinate!

20:34.800 --> 20:37.590
Orochi... Attack...

20:42.840 --> 20:45.640
Eldoraaa...!

20:45.640 --> 20:47.270
Chiyori...

20:47.270 --> 20:49.310
Hurry...

20:49.310 --> 20:51.610
This is the last turn...

20:51.610 --> 20:53.850
N-No...

20:53.850 --> 20:55.080
Chiyori!

20:59.320 --> 21:00.840
Chiyori...

21:02.190 --> 21:05.590
I really... liked you.

21:08.500 --> 21:10.660
Turn end.

21:10.660 --> 21:12.700
This is the end.

21:12.700 --> 21:15.790
Now, to wait for the finishing blow...

21:36.790 --> 21:39.820
You're late, Aki-lovely...

21:41.660 --> 21:43.500
That ain't me now...

21:43.500 --> 21:47.000
Right now, I'm Aoi Akira...

21:47.000 --> 21:50.960
The one who will beat and save you...

21:52.470 --> 21:55.900
"That Abrupt Separation"

21:53.810 --> 21:55.900
...Aoi Akira.

22:02.320 --> 22:03.750
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.750 --> 22:09.220
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:09.220 --> 22:13.760
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:13.760 --> 22:15.400
<i>I do...</i>

22:15.400 --> 22:21.000
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:21.000 --> 22:25.710
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:25.710 --> 22:31.180
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:31.180 --> 22:37.350
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:37.350 --> 22:42.420
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:42.420 --> 22:52.420
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:54.230 --> 22:59.270
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:59.270 --> 23:05.980
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:05.980 --> 23:11.050
<i>Release myself towards the future I selected</i>

23:11.050 --> 23:13.650
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.650 --> 23:20.790
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:26.830 --> 23:30.600
Shut up... Shut up... Shut up...!

23:30.600 --> 23:32.740
What...? That's wrong...

23:32.740 --> 23:34.740
That's absolutely wrong!

23:34.740 --> 23:38.510
Otherwise, that's absolutely and completely wrong!

23:38.480 --> 23:40.940
"This Warmth Is at Its Limit"

23:38.510 --> 23:40.780
This Warmth Is at Its Limit.
